<!--
  The launcher mark: a measured floor plan.

  Chosen over the abstract rectangle-and-dot it replaces because that mark said "shape",
  not "measure a room" — it was correct and uninterpretable. Three things carry the
  meaning here, and each was tested against a mock store shelf before being kept:

  * **The door swing arc.** The single mark that makes a rectangle read as architecture
    rather than as a box. Almost everybody recognises it and nobody can say why.
  * **No window.** It is in the store icon and not here. Two glazing lines 1.3 units apart
    merge into one floating bar well before 48 px, which is the same glitch the concept
    round removed — and at launcher size the detail was never legible anyway.
  * **The dimension arrow.** The borrowed category signal. A double-headed arrow says
    "measured" pre-verbally and, unlike a ruler's graduations, survives being shrunk to a
    48 px launcher tile — which is what this asset is for. The graduated variant is the
    store listing's icon, where the detail is affordable.

  Deliberately no camera or phone. It is the most cloned element in this category, and a
  phone silhouette eats the tile and leaves the plan too small to read. That message
  belongs in the screenshots and the feature graphic.

  **Sized to the safe circle, not the canvas.** An adaptive icon is 108 wide, but only a
  circle of radius 36 about the centre survives every launcher mask — the corners of the
  nominal 72 square are clipped by a round one. Every extreme point here is inside that
  circle; the furthest is the back corner of a dimension arrowhead at r=35.5.

  Colours are literal because the system rasterises this outside any theme. They are
  MeasureColours Surface, Ink and Accent.
-->
<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:width="108dp"
    android:height="108dp"
    android:viewportWidth="108"
    android:viewportHeight="108">

    <!-- Walls, cut only for the door. -->
    <path android:fillColor="#FFFFFF" android:pathData="M30,30 h48 v5 h-48 z" />
    <path android:fillColor="#FFFFFF" android:pathData="M30,30 h5 v36 h-5 z" />
    <path android:fillColor="#FFFFFF" android:pathData="M73,30 h5 v36 h-5 z" />
    <path android:fillColor="#FFFFFF" android:pathData="M30,61 h10 v5 h-10 z" />
    <path android:fillColor="#FFFFFF" android:pathData="M50,61 h28 v5 h-28 z" />

    <!-- The door: leaf standing open, and the quarter it sweeps. -->
    <path android:fillColor="#2F6BFF" android:pathData="M38.3,51 h3.4 v10 h-3.4 z" />
    <path
        android:strokeColor="#2F6BFF"
        android:strokeWidth="2.9"
        android:fillColor="#00000000"
        android:pathData="M40,51 A10,10 0 0 1 50,61" />

    <!-- The dimension: run and two heads. -->
    <path android:fillColor="#2F6BFF" android:pathData="M37,74.2 h34 v3.6 h-34 z" />
    <path android:fillColor="#2F6BFF" android:pathData="M30,76 L39,71.8 L39,80.2 z" />
    <path android:fillColor="#2F6BFF" android:pathData="M78,76 L69,71.8 L69,80.2 z" />
</vector>
